WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.986
I just want to say thank you for this

00:00:01.986 --> 00:00:04.240
experience. It has really been a pleasure.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.880
It has been fun and I have really learned a lot.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.880
You actually want to help people.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:14.360
It's not just like you are selling your service to a person.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.680
You actually want to help.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.680
It's something you miss seeing more of.
